<p style="font-size: 15px; text-align: center;"><strong>Krisala Aventis</strong><br />
<strong>Premium 2 &amp; 3 Bed Residences</strong></p>
<div class="ewa-rteLine">Krisala Aventis introduces Pune’s First Guilt-Free Homes, thoughtfully designed around healthier everyday living. With spacious 2 &amp; 3 Bed Residences, natural light, ventilation and efficient layouts, every home is planned to maximise usable space while supporting comfort, wellness and everyday ease.</div>
